# Admin and moderator panel copy — English (source catalog).
#
# Per the "Admin / mod panels" decision recorded in docs/i18n.md these are extracted
# but ship English-only: Power Users are ~5% of the audience and generally
# tolerate English tooling. Extracting them now means adding a language later is
# a data-only change with no code to touch.
#
# `render_admin` renders in the REQUEST locale, so a key translated here is picked
# up immediately. Untranslated keys fall through the locale chain to this file,
# which is why the panels still read English while `adm-*` has no other catalog.
#
# Keys are derived from the English source text, which makes an untranslated key
# self-describing if it ever leaks into the UI.

